You should try this (sorry for reinventing the wheel):

gpg --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com <http://keyserver.ubuntu.com> --recv-key E084DAB9
gpg -a --export E084DAB9 | sudo apt-key add -

I remember that there were some problems with GPG keys... you're not the only one with that problem. I solved it by switching to ArchLinux. =)

Apart from problems with keys, everything else sounds perfectly normal - just head over to w3schools, they have good tutorials (even for jQuery), and IMHO, jQuery is really easy to learn (if you have basic understanding of JS).

Good luck!

